{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0022-s003", "text": "Fråga mer i din kommuns rådgivningstjänster.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0022-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.249251700680272, "peak": 0.274566650390625, "generation_seconds": 9.326054556062445, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0023-s001", "text": "Du kan också leta upp en privat familjedagvårdare som vårdar barnen hemma hos sig, eller anställa en skötare i ditt eget hem.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0023-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 10.448979591836734, "peak": 0.365386962890625, "generation_seconds": 25.479528767988086, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0023-s002", "text": "Om du anställer en skötare i ditt hem blir du en arbetsgivare, och du måste uppfylla en arbetsgivares skyldigheter.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0023-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 9.891700680272109, "peak": 0.3304443359375, "generation_seconds": 21.320509989978746, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0023-s003", "text": "Familjen kan anställa en skötare i sitt hem även tillsammans med en annan familj.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0023-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.1053061224489795, "peak": 0.306182861328125, "generation_seconds": 15.343488271115348, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0024-s001", "text": "Kommunen övervakar den privata småbarnspedagogiken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0024-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.876190476190477, "peak": 0.262603759765625, "generation_seconds": 11.299613842973486, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0025-s001", "text": "Priserna för den privata småbarnspedagogiken varierar.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0025-s001.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 5.224489795918367, "peak": 0.29541015625, "generation_seconds": 14.236819525947794, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0025-s002", "text": "Du kan emellertid få stöd för den från FPA.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0025-s002.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 4.1099319727891155, "peak": 0.268310546875, "generation_seconds": 9.71900139306672, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
{"sentence_id": "hb-c08-u0025-s003", "text": "Då är den inte nödvändigtvis mycket dyrare än den kommunala småbarnspedagogiken.", "engine": "supertonic", "voice": "F1", "speed": 0.95, "seed": 42, "path": "studio/media/hb-c08-smabarn/narration/resume-20261103T013253993975+0000-3/hb-c08-u0025-s003.wav", "sample_rate": 44100, "seconds": 7.035646258503402, "peak": 0.28271484375, "generation_seconds": 15.723330958047882, "intra_op_num_threads": 2}
